.
.  Plot for Normal CDF table
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na norpdftb.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Normal PDF
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
Y1LABEL Probability Density
X1LABEL X
.
SET X11 HARDWARE FILL OFF
REGION FILL OFF ON
REGION BASE 0 ALL
.
PLOT NORPDF(X) FOR X = -4 0.01 4 AND
PLOT NORPDF(X) FOR X = 0 0.01 0.5
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system cp NORPDFTB.PS norpdftb.ps
system rm NORPDFTB.PS
.
. quit
